---

---

<section id="about" class="py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Photo -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 reveal flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Accent border ring -->
          <div
            class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-2xl opacity-60 blur-sm"
            style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-secondary));"
          ></div>
          <img
            src="/images/profile.png"
            alt="Kifansa Naufal Fadhlurrohman — Data Analyst"
            class="relative w-64 h-64 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl"
            style="border: 3px solid var(--bg-surface);"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="reveal text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2" style="color: var(--accent);">
          About Me
        </p>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1 section-heading" style="color: var(--text);">
          Passionate about uncovering stories hidden in data
        </h2>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 section-line"></div>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
            I'm an <strong style="color: var(--text);">Information Systems</strong> student at
            <strong style="color: var(--text);">Telkom University Surabaya</strong> with a strong
            foundation in data analytics, machine learning, and tech-driven operations.
            Maintaining a <strong style="color: var(--accent);">GPA of 3.89/4.00</strong>, I balance
            academic excellence with intensive technical and leadership roles.
          </p>
          <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
            My journey in data started with a curiosity about how numbers can tell stories and
            drive real business impact. Since then, I've earned multiple
            <strong style="color: var(--text);">Google Professional Certificates</strong> in
            Data Analysis and AI, and gained hands-on experience coaching students through
            data mining lifecycles as a Teaching Assistant.
          </p>
          <p class="reveal reveal-delay-4">
            I thrive on transforming raw, messy datasets into clear, actionable insights — whether
            it's building interactive dashboards, running predictive models, or presenting findings
            that stakeholders can immediately act on. Currently seeking opportunities to bring
            my analytical skills to a team where data drives decisions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
